; Run-IO - what reading the game's pk4 costs (PLAN.md section 14): opening
; it, random seeks and reads, reads straight on, through stdio and dos.library.
; Nothing is shown; under a minute.
;   CD to this directory, then:   Execute Run-IO
;   Another file:                 Execute Run-IO FILE=Work:big.file
.key FILE/K,N/K
.def FILE "Stuff:doom3/demo/demo00.pk4"
.def N 100
.bra {
.ket }
FailAt 21
MakeDir results >NIL:
Info >results/io.txt
io_probe {FILE} {N} >>results/io.txt
Echo "exit code $RC" >>results/io.txt
Type results/io.txt
